Phase 11 passes the resolved value to the evidence script (`publish`), which decides what each value means for the evidence comment. From the same line: {{compliance.compliance_frameworks()}}
<!-- compliance:off -->
{{publication_resolve()}}
Phase 11 passes no publication value: the local verify posts nothing. From the same line: {{compliance.compliance_frameworks()}}
<!-- compliance:end -->

{{compliance.compliance_inject()}}

Pass `COMPLIANCE_DIRECTIVE` to every Code and Fix spawn, on a line of its own.

{{decisions_load()}}
<!-- curation:on -->
Pass `DECISIONS_CONTEXT` to Code agent (Phase 2) and Harden agent (Phase 4).

